# HMC clover fermions: 4^4 lattice
# Test the clover fermion force implementation

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 4
nY: 4
nZ: 4
nT: 4

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 5.6
Update Method: hmc
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: cold

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 0
Number of Configurations: 0
Sweeps Between Measurements: 1
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 0
Configuration Save Frequency: 100
Save Binary Configs: off
Random Seed: 42

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: off
Measure Polyakov: off
Measure Correlators: off
Verbose Output: on

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.12
Wilson r: 1.0
Use Clover: on
c_SW: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 1000
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-10
Solver Type: bicgstab

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 10
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 5
